 },
 "summary": "A family of 47 single silicon Zener diodes in the SOD-123 surface-mount package, rated 500 mW, with nominal Zener voltages from 2.4 V to 75 V. Each type has a two-character type code. They serve as voltage references in regulated supplies and as clamps against overvoltage. MMSZ5235B is the 6.8 V type: 6.46 V to 7.14 V at 20 mA, code E5.",
